  m_text: 'The village doesn''t have much time so you will need to collect enough
    food to feed the village before the timer runs out. Each crop posseses its own
    value in money and nutrition which will be rewarded when the crop is sold. In
    the top of screen there will be a quota needed to feed the village along with
    your current amount of money.

