  m_text: 'The top of the screen shows the players inventory of all the items they
    currently have including seeds, crops, and money.  In the top right the time
    left to complete the food quota is shown and will count down once you start farming.
    There is also the quota bar to show progress in feeding the village.


    You
    can pres ESC at anytime to return to the main menu or to restart your run. Pres
    ESC again to leave the option menu.'
