      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Every Farmer has their tools. Your tools are the Hoe, Watering Can, Shears,
    and Axe. To pickup a tool you will need to walk over it and press E to pick it
    up. Once picked up it will show you in the top which tool you are currently holding.
    You cannot carry more than one tool at a time so you will need to press Q to
    drop your current tool in order to pickup another. In order to use the tools
    just look at the direction you want to use them and press SPACE BAR while you
    are currently holding the tool.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
