      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Beware there are hungry vermin that wish to steal away your crops. Mice
    will go through the farm to eat your crops and the only way to stop them is to
    exterminate them using your axe. To use your axe simply equip it and press space
    facing a mouse to kill it before it reaches your crops.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
