      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Step 1: till the grass into farmable dirt


    Step 2: Select a seed
    using 1-Wheat, 2-Tomato, 3-Corn

    (an arrow will be above the selected seed)


    Step
    3: look at the tilled dirt and press space with the seed selected to plant the
    seed


    step 4: Water the plant with the watering can making it grow 1 stage(the
    ground will be dark when wattered)


    step 5: once the plant is fully grown
    grab the shears and harvest the crop'
